hall be responsible to maintain and repair the machinery and equipment that are used for ground maintenance in case of break down at its own expense. ... n) CAU will submit a sum of INR 03 lacs as a Refundable Security Deposit to occupy the office space. ...\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"penalty_clauses\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"(8) TERM, SUSPENSION AND TRANSITION: b) SUSPENSION\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspension and termination for non-compliance or breach, with payment obligations continuing during suspension.\",\n      \"penaltyDetails\": \"If the CAU fails to comply with the provisions of this Agreement, DIAL may, after giving 7 days' notice to the CAU, suspend the further usage of ground/rented space. ... If the suspension under this sub-clause continues for a period of 15 days then DIAL may, upon giving 7 days notice to the CAU, terminate the agreement. Upon such termination, DIAL shall be entitled to receive payment of fixed monthly rental for the whole period till the date of termination.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"arbitration_clause\": {\n    \"amicable_settlement\": \"All disputes and differences of any kind, whatsoever, arising out of or in connection with this Agreement if not resolved amicably shall be referred to the sole arbitrator.\",\n    \"arbitration\": \"To be nominated/appointed by DIAL in accordance with the Indian Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996.\",\n    \"arbitral_tribunal\": \"Sole arbitrator nominated/appointed by DIAL.\",\n    \"final_and_binding\": \"\",\n    \"seat_and_venue\": \"Mumbai\",\n    \"language\": \"English\",\n    \"costs\": \"\",\n    \"additional\": \"The Courts in Mumbai will have the exclusive jurisdiction to entertain and try any dispute hereunder. This Agreement shall be subject to the Laws of India.\"\n  }\n}"